<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Panamco raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Panamco raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said it had raised its rating for Latin American Coca-Cola bottler Panamerican Beverages Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The rating change was made on Feb 3.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were off 1-1/2 to 51-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
